        {
          "name": "assignments",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:c5929c5de1b1ac5380247ae9882526ca79f636cfdbb98c4fb1ecb84bcadf2402",
          "description": "All hand-in assignments with their window, status (AANKOMEND, IN_TE_LEVEREN, IN_AFWACHTING, AKKOORD), teLaat (boolean when the item has a hand-in window: true only if a digital hand-in was required, the deadline has passed and nothing was submitted; false for paper/in-class items with inleveringenVerwacht 0 or missing — also flagged geenDigitaleInlevering; omitted when there is no hand-in window), description, attachments and links. status=open keeps upcoming and to-do ones, and by default hides past-due items where no digital hand-in is expected (inleveringenVerwacht 0 or missing, e.g. on paper; count in verborgenZonderInlevering); includeNoHandIn=true keeps them. Near-duplicates (same subject, topic, window and status, e.g. published to two groups) are merged by default, with the other ids in duplicaatToekenningIds; dedupe=false lists them separately. Use toekenningId with assignment_detail.",
          "is_mutating": false,
          "property_keys": [
